dant properties that supports the immune system, tissue regeneration and collagen production.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"876\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-343.jpg\" alt=\"Hands resting on the knee\" class=\"wp-image-891\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-343.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-343-300x205.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-343-1024x701.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-343-768x526.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-343-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Alpha Lipoic Acid<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A strong antioxidant that helps to regenerate other antioxidants such as vitamins C and E and supports nerve health and metabolism.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-344.jpg\" alt=\"Hands forming a heart on the stomach\" class=\"wp-image-892\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-344.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-344-300x156.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-344-1024x534.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-344-768x400.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-344-18x9.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immune Plus<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Supports immune function, energy metabolism and antioxidant capacity.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-345.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman holding a green smoothie\" class=\"wp-image-893\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-345.jpg 1280w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-345-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-345-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-345-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife.de\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-photo-345-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anti-ageing Collagen Booster<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Amino acids, vitamins and minerals that support collagen production, skin health and overall vitality.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"w